<title>SRI LANKA: Three, six-month Sri Lanka T-bill yields fall.</title>
<headline>Three, six-month Sri Lanka T-bill yields fall.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield on three and six-month Sri Lankan treasury bills fell, while 12-month yields were unchanged, Sri Lanka's central bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Bids amounted to 5,278 million, it added.</p>
<p>		    bids received  bids accepted avg yield</p>
<p>     3 months     2,140	     1,860	18.20 (18.21)</p>
<p>     6 months	 185		 110	18.03 (18.04)</p>
<p>    12 months     2,953	     2,434	17.93 (17.93)</p>
<p>NOTE - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets).</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
